<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6806" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνακρίνω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>examine closely, interrogate,</i> esp. judicially, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Παυσανίαν</span></b> 
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.95
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Antipho
				2.1.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Smp.</u>
				201e
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τινὰ πόθεν ζῇ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Diph.
					32.3
				</span></i>
			; <i>sound</i> a person, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>1 Ki.</u>
				20.12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>inquire into,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τοὺς ἐργασαμένους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antipho
					2.3.2
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν [αἰτίαν</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Po.</u>
				994
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				21
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Lib.</u>
				p.21
			</span></i> O.:—
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ποινὰ τίς ἔσται</span>
			what remedy there shall be, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				4.63
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>examine</i> magistrates so as to prove their qualification,
				<i><span class="en">
				D.
				57.66
			</span></i> and <i><span class="en">
				70
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of the
			magistrates, <i>examine</i> persons concerned in a suit, so as to
			prepare the matter for trial, <i><span class="en">
				And.
				1.101
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Is.
				5.32
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ ἄρχων ἀνέκρινε πᾶσιν ὑμῖν
				καὶ ἀνακρίνας ει&lt;&gt;σήγαγεν εἰς τὸ
				δικαστήριον</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
				48.31
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Ath.</u>
				56.6
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνεκρίθησαν αἱ ἀμφισβητήσεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					48.23
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκ ἀνεκρίνατο ταύτην [τὴν
				γραφήν</span>] <i>he did</i> not <i>have</i> it
				<i>examined,</i> of the prosecutor, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				21.103
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				53.17
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> generally,
				<i>examine,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μάρτυρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					953.46
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Calymna</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Cor.</u>
				9.3
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Michel</u>
				409.9
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Cos</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>select,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ps.-Callisth.
				3.26
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> in 
				Med.
			, abs., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνακρίνεσθαι πρὸς
				ἑωυτούς</span>
			<i>dispute, wrangle</i> one with another, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				9.56
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
